  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Handmade cardboard box with lid, secured with a cloth strap and buckle. Designed to look like a box for field specimens. The box houses four cases with "insects" constructed of photo-collages, pinned to a white Styrofoam background and labeled with the "insect's" name and country of origin.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
